    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk. \"letting the exhaustion take over\" sounds okay, i guess. but it's not just being tired. it's like the story is already written, you know? the peak was years ago. there's no more chapters left, just this long, slow epilogue where I'm just... waiting for the credits to roll. it feels a bit pointless to keep pretending there's something else coming.",
