      "content": "\"letting the fade-to-black happen naturally\"... i've never heard anyone put it like that. it almost sounds more dignified than just dragging this out. like, instead of just decaying, you just... finish. do you really think that's a valid way to look at it? that there's a point where a life is just... done?",
